}}The '''Spear of Vlad the Impaler''' is an artifact that was necessary to enter the [[Castle of Vlad Dracul]] and at one time held the [[Titan]] [[Antedeluvian]]. It is able to unlock the castle by being inserted into the molded wound of one of the statues at the castle's gates.

== History ==
According to [[Sophie Casterwill]], the spear at one time did hold the vampiric titan [[Antedeluvian]], who later bonded with [[Vlad Dracul]], the Impaler. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}

The Spear eventually fell into the hands of [[The Organization]] and was stored in [[Klaus' bookshop]] alongside the [[Bottle of Djinn]]. After outsmarting Klaus, Dante acquired the spear. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}

Dante used the Spear to allow him and the Huntik team entry into the castle by inserting into the wound of Vlad's statue. {{source|The Vampire Loses Its Fangs}}

[[Zhalia Moon]] used the Spear to allow the [[Blood Spiral]] entry to the castle after they had taken out the Huntik Foundation Operatives stationed outside the castle. {{source|Lok's Leadership}}
